{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlelementposition\/element"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLElementPosition\/element","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"element","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Maps to the MusicXML ","type":"text"},{"code":"element","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" attribute.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"metadata":{"title":"element","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"element","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"externalID":"s:7IvorMXL18MXLElementPositionV7elementSSSgvp","roleHeading":"Instance Property","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLElementPosition"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The element type for a descendant of the next sibling element that is not a link or bookmark."}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","title":"IvorMXL","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","kind":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLElementPosition/element":{"title":"element","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"element"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLElementPosition\/element","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlelementposition\/element","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The element type for a descendant of the next sibling element that is not a link or bookmark.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLElementPosition":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLElementPosition","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlelementposition","title":"MXLElementPosition","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The element and position attributes are new as of Version 2.0. They allow for bookmarks and links to be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"positioned at higher resolution than the level of music-data elements. When no element and position attributes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are present, the bookmark or link element refers to the next sibling element in the MusicXML file. The element","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"attribute specifies an element type for a descendant of the next sibling element that is not a link or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"bookmark. The position attribute specifies the position of this descendant element, where the first position","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is 1. The position attribute is ignored if the element attribute is not present. For instance, an element","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"value of “beam” and a position value of “2” defines the link or bookmark to refer to the second beam","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"descendant of the next sibling element that is not a link or bookmark. This is equivalent to an XPath test of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"[.\/\/beam[2]] done in the context of the sibling element.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLElementPosition"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLElementPosition"}]}}}